* CVSD encoder A — breadboard baseline
* LM311 + TL072 (Iabc + follower) + LM13700 + 74HC74/86/32
* mf8-spec.md §12.1, cvsd-codec.md §3.1, §3.2, falstad CVSD-ENC
*
* Pins: AUDIO CLK BIT NBIT Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

.subckt cvsd_enc_a AUDIO CLK BIT NBIT Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

* LM311 PARTS macromodel: OC off (pull-up high) when IN+ > IN−.
* + = AUDIO, − = Y → AUDIO > Y → bit 1 (cvsd.py).
Xcmp AUDIO Y VCC VEE CMP 0 LM311
Rpull CMP VDD 4.7k

* Digital run register + XOR/OR coincidence (one ADC, one DAC)
Xlogic CMP CLK BIT NBIT NCOIN CVSD_LOGIC

* Syllabic filter: τ=5 ms, ratio ≈51
R1 NCOIN SYL 51.1k
R2 SYL 0 2.55Meg
Csyl SYL 0 100n

* Iabc: TL072 + 2N3906, EMIT tracks SYL, Iabc=(VA−SYL)/Rset
Rvref VDD VA 100
Cvref VA 0 100u
Xoa SYL VA_EMIT VCC VEE BASE TL072
Qp IABC BASE VA_EMIT Q2N3906
Rset VA VA_EMIT 30.9k

* LM13700 half: diodes open (LIN), buffer unused (BIN/BUF open)
Rd1 BIT  INP 47k
Rd2 INP  0   2.2k
Rd3 NBIT INN 47k
Rd4 INN  0   2.2k
Rlin LIN 0 100Meg
Rbin BIN 0 100Meg
Rbuf BUF 0 100Meg
Xota LIN INP INN IABC INT VCC VEE BIN BUF HALF13700

* Integrator + TL072 follower
Cint INT 0 10n
Rint INT 0 100k
Xfoll INT Y VCC VEE Y TL072

.ends cvsd_enc_a
